    Bug 782629 - Enable test_nntpContentLength.js by rewriting it to verify actual stream data. r=mkmelin

    Rewrite the test from the synchronous run_test() pattern to async add_task(),
    verifying content integrity via asyncOpen + PromiseStreamListener rather than
    checking channel.contentLength before open (which was always 0). Also add a
    "bytes" header to the fake server's NewsArticle so the HEAD response includes
    the article size.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D307968

